&lt;p&gt;给定一个只含有1或者2的数组，让你找出一个子数组，子数组要求是$n个1 和 m个2$并要求$min(n,m)$最大。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>[cf541D]Gourmet choice (缩点+dfs)</title><link>https://www.cheasim.com/2019/03/05/cf541d-gourmet-choice-%E7%BC%A9%E7%82%B9-dfs/</link><pubDate>Tue, 05 Mar 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.cheasim.com/2019/03/05/cf541d-gourmet-choice-%E7%BC%A9%E7%82%B9-dfs/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="gourmet-choice" class="reading-heading"&gt;Gourmet choice&lt;a class="heading-anchor" href="#gourmet-choice" aria-label="链接到：Gourmet choice"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
